{"unit_id":"tag:05Q8:statement","translation":"设<MATH_0001>是范畴（category），<MATH_0002>是乘性的（multiplicative）系统（system）。若除MS1、MS2、MS3外还有以下性质，就称<MATH_0003>是<TEXTITOPEN_0001>饱和的（saturated）<TEXTITCLOSE_0001>：\n<STRUCT_0001>\n<ITEMOPEN_0001>MS4<ITEMCLOSE_0001> 给定三个可合成的（composable）态射（morphisms）<MATH_0004>，若<MATH_0005>，则<MATH_0006>。\n<STRUCT_0002>\n","allowed_english":["MS"],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"category","target_term":"范畴"},{"source_term":"multiplicative","target_term":"乘性的"},{"source_term":"system","target_term":"系统"},{"source_term":"saturated","target_term":"饱和的"},{"source_term":"composable","target_term":"可合成的"},{"source_term":"morphisms","target_term":"态射"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"category","target_term":"范畴","context":"原范畴；待决。"},{"source_term":"multiplicative","target_term":"乘性的","context":"给定系统的条件；待决。"},{"source_term":"system","target_term":"系统","context":"指定态射系统；待决。"},{"source_term":"saturated","target_term":"饱和的","context":"本定义引入的附加性质；待决。"},{"source_term":"composable","target_term":"可合成的","context":"三个态射可合成的条件；待决。"},{"source_term":"morphisms","target_term":"态射","context":"饱和条件中的态射；待决。"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:04VB:prose-0009","translation":"\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n注意，饱和的（saturated）乘性的（multiplicative）系统（system）包含所有同构（isomorphisms）。此外，若<MATH_0001>是可合成的（composable）态射（morphisms），所在为某个范畴（category），且<MATH_0002>是同构（isomorphisms），则<MATH_0003>是同构（isomorphism）（因为此时<MATH_0004>同时具有左、右逆（inverse），故可逆（invertible））。\n\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"saturated","target_term":"饱和的"},{"source_term":"multiplicative","target_term":"乘性的"},{"source_term":"system","target_term":"系统"},{"source_term":"isomorphisms","target_term":"同构"},{"source_term":"composable","target_term":"可合成的"},{"source_term":"morphisms","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"category","target_term":"范畴"},{"source_term":"isomorphisms","target_term":"同构"},{"source_term":"isomorphism","target_term":"同构"},{"source_term":"inverse","target_term":"逆"},{"source_term":"invertible","target_term":"可逆"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"saturated","target_term":"饱和的","context":"系统的饱和性；待决。"},{"source_term":"multiplicative","target_term":"乘性的","context":"系统的乘性条件；待决。"},{"source_term":"system","target_term":"系统","context":"给定乘性系统；待决。"},{"source_term":"isomorphisms","target_term":"同构","context":"系统包含的及复合所得的同构；待决。"},{"source_term":"composable","target_term":"可合成的","context":"给定态射可合成；待决。"},{"source_term":"morphisms","target_term":"态射","context":"给定三个态射；待决。"},{"source_term":"category","target_term":"范畴","context":"这些态射所在的范畴；待决。"},{"source_term":"isomorphism","target_term":"同构","context":"由左右逆推出的同构性；待决。"},{"source_term":"inverse","target_term":"逆","context":"原文并列共享的左、右逆；待决。"},{"source_term":"invertible","target_term":"可逆","context":"同时有左右逆的结论；待决。"}],"notes":[]}
